+# Instruction and verification checklist
+
+| User requirement or methodological issue | Outcome and location | Remaining limit |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Continue available work; keep missing inputs as TODOs | Three indexed court PDFs acquired/read; OPEN-TODOS retains DRAFT-T01–T06 | Native inputs and original eighteen criteria remain open/partial |
+| Avoid repeating completed searches | Prior published queue identifies326/639 as unexamined; explicit court939 attachment link used | No generic repeat search or 336/337 acquisition this unit |
+| Preserve originals and prior assessments | Source hashes/bytes/pages checked; predecessors retained | Preservation does not authenticate native origin or historical truth |
+| Preserve conflict rather than adjudicate | README sections1–2; pins R01–R05 retain field concern, uncertainty, later caution and tasking | Referenced earlier communication and each author's exact inputs unknown |
+| Distinguish source reports, intention, delivery and outcome | Requested checks, promised handoff and reported circulation separately labeled | Actual receipt, returned intelligence and legal dispositions not supplied |
+| Prevent false thread joins | August15/16 in326 kept separate from August24 in637 | No native Message-ID, attachment or timezone authentication |
+| Compare parent/attachment without double counting | 939p3–4 explicitly names639; standalone639/p5 compared manually | No pixel/native identity or independent corroboration asserted |
+| Keep contrary evidence and alternatives | Continuing tasking/dissemination, uncertainty and possible threshold differences retained | Neither suppression nor an innocent cause established |
+| Exact source links and locators | SOURCES and SOURCE-PINS provide URLs/hashes/physical pages/header/paragraphs; README line locators are our text only | No invented source line numbers or unperformed full-source reading |
+| Revision accountability | TEXT-CHANGES.diff supplies exact additions; old report/TODO versions unchanged | New research note, not an original-email/draft diff; layout/source reading separate |
+| Safe AveLyra public publication | Frozen candidate excludes raw scans/images/OCR, signatures, personal/contact/passport and private-case material | Actual identity, commit, remote ref and every file body must be verified after commit/push; no merge claim |
+| Maintain role/goal boundaries | No technical-owner/shared-register or legal-case edits; original five tracks remain open | Publication is not substantive acceptance or completion |
+
+Reading: all seven new pages; two held636/637 pages reinspected. No hidden text/OCR/redaction reconstruction, outreach, mailbox access, fee, filing/request, deletion, private push or history rewrite. SOURCE-CHECKS is a byte/structure/reference check, not a historical-proof score. A local publication receipt records actual subsequent remote verification separately.
